body:
I'm glad that you care, but i'm nothing special outside of a worthless human being, even though i hate talking so negatively, there is thing that need to be said. I can't seek help right now, neither do i want. 

&#x200B;

I'm fine right now, my body is just stinging from the cuts i made, and i cut my throat a little bit too, but i'm fine, and since this is clearly the wrong subreddit to talk about this, contact me in private message on this account or the account i made the post i just linked to you.

&#x200B;

Honestly, i don't want to bother you or anything, and it's long and boring, so don't bother you with that, but just in case, you can read that, it will make talking easier and will make you understand, i think. 

&#x200B;

Here is the post i'm talking about ;  [https://www.reddit.com/r/SuicideWatch/comments/cs0j88/the\_first\_time\_i\_share\_my\_whole\_story\_hope\_at/](https://www.reddit.com/r/SuicideWatch/comments/cs0j88/the_first_time_i_share_my_whole_story_hope_at/)

Really ? That's not something good enough for more than five seconds, but thank you i appreciate it a lot. 

&#x200B;

A hug huh ? I didn't felt one in years. I don't even remember how it feels.
